{"id": "c002", "parent": "c001", "source_sha256": "ea47b71b2a72e9498f0baa5fead365fc2e4864cd85f83946ae175689f45ad75c", "hypothesis": "Removing the int(q_lens.max().item()) device->host sync (a full stream round-trip) on launch-bound cases will cut the ~0.095ms fixed host cost that dominates the tiny/small workloads (total_q<=92, majority of the geomean). For total_q<=BLOCK_M every sequence fits in one m-block so n_m_blocks=1 with no sync; large cases keep the c001 single-sync path.", "change_from_parent": "launch plumbing only: skip the device->host max-reduction/.item() sync when total_q<=BLOCK_M (n_m_blocks=1). Triton kernel body byte-identical to c001; output/lse init unchanged (zeros/-inf).", "config": {"BLOCK_M": 128, "BLOCK_N": 64, "num_warps": 8, "num_stages": 2, "grid": "V1-dense; sync-free for total_q<=128", "qk_precision": "bf16-dot-fp32-accum", "launch": "sync-free-small", "host_syncs": "0 for total_q<=128, else 1", "causal_skip": true}, "validation": {"correct": true, "workloads_passed": 21, "workloads_total": 21, "failures": [], "tolerance": {"atol": 0.01, "rtol": 0.01, "matched_ratio": 0.99}}, "per_workload": [{"uuid": "f7a038e9-6c18-4fd6-9b79-e349a4c79bd8", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 7, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.92}, {"uuid": "f4c23a33-b16b-4ee8-bb86-440562adf047", "regime": "micro", "axes": {"total_q": 1, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 6.26}, {"uuid": "bad384fa-037d-474f-9a09-0e9f1bb8f43e", "regime": "tiny", "axes": {"total_q": 35, "len_indptr": 2}, "correct": true, "speedup": 7.05}, {"uuid": "2068cdff-fad7-43d3-b018-490349ad9776", "regime": "small", "axes": {"total_q": 81, "len_indptr": 3}, "correct": true, "speedup": 12.68}, {"uuid": "6f3e1bfe-2209-4921-9be4-beed5c9744cb", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 13557, "len_indptr": 26}, "correct": true, "speedup": 32.69}, {"uuid": "adefedc4-d82a-43ca-800e-51557b08b446", "regime": "large", "axes": {"total_q": 12845, "len_indptr": 37}, "correct": true, "